# Never copy host build artefacts or deps — the image installs its own (host node_modules is macOS-native
# and would break a Linux container). Each service Dockerfile copies only the workspace it needs.
#
# NOTE: this used to also exclude apps/web/src and apps/web/next.config.mjs (it was written for an
# API-only image). That silently broke the web container — `next build` with no src produces an empty
# app. Kept generic now so both the API and web images build from the same context.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
.git
**/*.env
**/*.env.*
coverage
playwright-report
**/*.log
